          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lalapho iNkosi elithuma lisuka eKadeshi‐Barneya isithi: Hambani, lithumbe ilizwe engilinike lona; lahlamuka emlayweni weNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu, kaliyikholwanga, kalilalelanga lelizwi layo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.23",
