          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhuleka eNkosini ngathi: Nkosi Nkulunkulu, ungabachithi abantu bakho abayisizwe sakho obakhulule ngobukhulu bakho, wabakhupha eGibithe ngesandla esilamandla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumbula inceku zakho oAbrahama loIsaka loJakobe, ungakhangeli inkani yalababantu lobubi babo lesono sabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "funa abantu balelolizwe owasikhupha kilo bathi: Kungenxa yokuba iNkosi yehluleka ukubangenisa elizweni eyabathembisa lona, langenxa yokuba ibazonda, yabakhupha ukuba ibabulalele enkangala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba bangabantu bakho abayisizwe sakho, owabakhupha ngamandla akho amakhulu langengalo yakho elamandla.",
          "type": "text",
